  "observable_outcome": "The five frozen candidates are now executable against Week 1 2026 rather than merely described. Each fitted family is refit only on allowed evidence: 90,198 oriented rows across 45,099 contests from 1963 through 2023, with the protected seasons absent and no hyperparameter search performed, so hyperparameter drift against the frozen Cycle #20 candidate gate is zero. The logistic family fits its 60-column admitted design and prior_only fits the 26-column prior-outcome-and-site restriction of the same family, so no candidate family is silently replaced and no sixth candidate is inserted. Missingness is carried by 20 learned indicators rather than substituted numerics: the fabricated-value count is zero and no required feature is left neither admitted nor indicator-covered. Across 910 candidate-contest-orientation cells, 798 are forecast-ready, 80 abstain as unsupported entities because eight participants hold an official organization identity with no canonical modelling history, and 32 abstain for missing required features where a cold-start prior is not admitted. Expected margin is claimed only by national_margin_ridge and a 95% interval only from its development residual dispersion; every other candidate records NOT_SUPPORTED_BY_MODEL_FAMILY and UNCERTAINTY_NOT_ESTABLISHED. No forecast is emitted from this unit, no candidate is recommended or promoted, the base-rate control is flagged never_recommended, both A&M checkpoints remain OPEN, and the focus contest is discovered from the bound authority gate with custom_correction_applied and tamu_specific_adjustment_applied both false.",
